I am not a Nethack God, but here's a some help you can get from the REAL Nethack
Gods:  (SPOILERS!!)

In levels one and two you usually encounter goblins and jackals.  These are the 
type of monsters you will use for the following hint.  I have found that when
you have 5 or less hit points ( I checked the source to find that it is true.)
and you pray, as long as it has been 300 turns since your last prayer, the 
Gods will heal you and give you 5 extra max Hp.  So what you could do is wander
levels one and two, and when it comes time to pray, let a monster hit you down
to 5 or less Hp, and then pray.  The monster will get a few more hits (3 or 4)
but I tend to lose only 10 or so Hp.  Usually after the prayer, I can kill the 
monster with no problems.  As I mentioned above, this works best with goblins
and jackals, oh yeah and {sewer, giant} rats as well.  If you keep doing this 
you could probably reach 60 Hp and be about 5th level for killing monsters
while you are waiting around to pray.  Also, these killed monsters usually can
keep you fed.  Hope this is a help for all you frustrated Nethackers.


